        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Oui, le produit est pens&eacute; comme un rituel r&eacute;p&eacute;table &agrave; domicile. Comme pour toute routine bien-&ecirc;tre, commencez progressivement et adaptez selon votre ressenti.{% else %}Yes, it is designed as a repeatable at-home ritual. As with any wellness routine, start gradually and adjust based on comfort.{% endif %}</p></div>
